    <aside class="profile-card"><img src="/images/siqi-chen-profile.jpg" alt="Siqi Chen" /><h2>Siqi Chen <span>陳思琦</span></h2><p data-en="Corporate Communications Professional · Hong Kong" data-zh="企业传讯专业人士 · 香港">Corporate Communications Professional · Hong Kong</p></aside>
    <article class="prose-card">
      <h2 data-en="Professional Profile" data-zh="职业简介">Professional Profile</h2>
      <p data-en="I am a Hong Kong-based corporate communications professional with experience across financial services, listed-company communications and public relations." data-zh="我是一名常驻香港的企业传讯专业人士，拥有金融服务、上市公司财经公关及公共关系等多元经验。">I am a Hong Kong-based corporate communications professional with experience across financial services, listed-company communications and public relations.</p>
      <p data-en="My career began in financial PR, where I supported around 15 Hong Kong-listed companies across corporate messaging, investor relations, media engagement and stakeholder events. I later broadened my experience into public and stakeholder relations before moving into an in-house corporate communications role within the financial services industry." data-zh="我的职业生涯始于财经公关，曾为约15家香港上市公司提供企业信息传达、投资者关系、媒体沟通及持份者活动支持。随后，我拓展至公共及持份者关系，并进入金融服务机构从事企业传讯工作。">My career began in financial PR, where I supported around 15 Hong Kong-listed companies across corporate messaging, investor relations, media engagement and stakeholder events. I later broadened my experience into public and stakeholder relations before moving into an in-house corporate communications role within the financial services industry.</p>
      <p data-en="My current work spans bilingual corporate communications, media relations, digital communications, corporate publications, ESG initiatives and brand management." data-zh="目前我的工作覆盖双语企业传讯、媒体关系、数字传播、企业刊物、ESG项目及品牌管理。">My current work spans bilingual corporate communications, media relations, digital communications, corporate publications, ESG initiatives and brand management.</p>
      <div class="edu-grid"><div><span>2019–2020</span><h3>The Hong Kong Polytechnic University</h3><p>Master of Business Management</p><strong data-en="HKD 110,000 scholarship recipient" data-zh="获港币110,000元奖学金">HKD 110,000 scholarship recipient</strong></div><div><span>2014–2018</span><h3>Xiamen University of Technology</h3><p>Bachelor in International Business</p></div></div>
